card.statement:
[B] Let $(\zeta, a, t, \lambda)\in (\text{Hom}_{\text{alg}}(\mathcal{H}_q^\prime(+), \C(q^{\frac{1}{2}}
 )), \C^\times, \C,  \dot{P})$.

- If $K^q_{\zeta, \lambda, t}$ is an irreducible $\mathcal{H}_q$-module (cf.Remark <<ref:rmk1>> (2)), then $\widehat{K}_{\zeta, \lambda, t}^q$ is an irreducible $\U_q(\ag)$-module.

- Is $M_{(\zeta,\lambda)}^{\prime,q}$ is an irreducible $\mathcal{H}_q^{\prime,d}$-module (cf. Section <<ref:qderaff>>), then the induced $\U_q([\ag.\ag])$-module $\widetilde{M}_{(\zeta,\lambda)}^{\prime,q}$ is irreducible.
